The Rust word packing in crates/plait-ops/src/packing.rs is adapted from
common_pack_weight in the Humming device header
humming/include/humming/kernel/pack_weight.cuh.

Upstream: https://github.com/vllm-project/humming
Revision: 8c787fb9702fec8e533274903959ec253199c69e
License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The headers in include/humming are the unmodified transitive includes of the
upstream humming.cuh GEMM and process.cuh weight repacker at the same revision.
w4a16_config.cuh adapts the upstream Humming JIT configuration for dense
groupwise W4A16, and plait-ops adapts the scale and zero point permutations
from humming/transform.py.

plait_humming_hip.cuh ports dense groupwise W4A16 tiling and staging to
CDNA3 MFMA, reusing the Humming scale and zero point layout.
